  abstract={We propose a cooperative perception framework for autonomous driving that focuses on temporal feature fusion to address communication latency and sensor asynchrony. Our approach achieves approximately 2.5% improvement in both 3D Average Precision (AP) and Bird's Eye View (BEV) AP at 500ms latency compared to the baseline FFNet method reported in NeurIPS 2023. The framework integrates vehicle-infrastructure cooperative sensing to enhance 3D object detection robustness in challenging communication environments.},
